## SearchApi

### Search pins by a given search term
## Search pins by a given search term
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/search/partner/pins?term={{term}}&countryCode={{countryCode}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&locale={{locale}}&limit={{limit}}
Accept: application/json

### Search user&#39;s boards
## Search user&#39;s boards
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/search/boards?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&query={{query}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Search user&#39;s Pins
## Search user&#39;s Pins
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/search/pins?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&query={{query}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}
Accept: application/json
